xmrig-amd
------------------------------------------
XMRig is high performance Monero (XMR) OpenCL miner, with the official full
Windows support.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libiconv2-1.19-2
  libintl8-0.26-1
  libmicrohttpd12-1.0.11-1bl1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libuv1-1.53.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libmicrohttpd-devel-1.0.11-1bl1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libuv-devel-1.53.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/xmrig/xmrig-amd

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/xmrig/xmrig-amd/archive/refs/tags/v2.14.6.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack xmrig-amd-2.14.6-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./xmrig-amd-2.14.6-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/xmrig-amd-2.14.6-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/xmrig-amd-2.14.6-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(xmrig-amd)
  /usr/bin/xmrig-amd.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/xmrig-amd.README
  /usr/share/doc/xmrig-amd/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/xmrig-amd/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/xmrig-amd/README.md

------------------

